{"surah":82,"ayahs":["إِذَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">مَآ</span>ءُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">نفَ</span>طَرَتْ","وَإِذَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْكَوَاكِبُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">نتَ</span>ثَرَتْ","وَإِذَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْبِحَارُ فُجِّرَتْ","وَإِذَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقُبُورُ بُعْثِرَتْ","عَلِمَتْ نَفْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">سٌ مَّ</span>ا قَدَّمَتْ وَأَخَّرَتْ","<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">يَٰٓ</span>أَيُّهَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْإِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ن</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">سَٰ</span>نُ مَا غَرَّكَ بِرَبِّكَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْكَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">رِي</span>مِ","ٱلَّذِى خَلَقَكَ فَسَوَّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ٮٰ</span>كَ فَعَدَلَكَ","<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">فِىٓ</span> أَىِّ صُورَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">ةٍ مَّ</span>ا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">شَآ</span>ءَ رَكَّبَكَ","كَلَّا بَلْ تُكَذِّبُونَ بِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">دِّي</span>نِ","وَإِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span> عَلَيْكُمْ لَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">حَٰ</span>فِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">ظِي</span>نَ","كِرَا<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">مًا </span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">كَٰ</span>تِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">بِي</span>نَ","يَعْلَمُونَ مَا تَفْعَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">لُو</span>نَ","إِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span> <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">بْ</span>رَارَ لَفِى نَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">عِي</span>مٍ","وَإِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span> <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْفُجَّارَ لَفِى جَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">حِي</span>مٍ","يَصْلَوْنَهَا يَوْمَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">دِّي</span>نِ","وَمَا هُمْ عَنْهَا بِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">غَآ</span>ئِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">بِي</span>نَ","وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">مَآ</span> أَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دْ</span>رَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ٮٰ</span>كَ مَا يَوْمُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">دِّي</span>نِ","ثُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">مَّ</span> <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">مَآ</span> أَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دْ</span>رَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ٮٰ</span>كَ مَا يَوْمُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">دِّي</span>نِ","يَوْمَ لَا تَمْلِكُ نَفْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">سٌ لِّ</span>نَفْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">سٍ شَ</span>يْـ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">ـًٔا‌ۖ وَ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَمْرُ يَوْمَئِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">ذٍ لِّ</span>لَّهِ"]}